// Rule 4 - Windows Firewall disabled via PowerShell or netsh
// Tactic: Defense Evasion (T1562.001)
// Proposed severity: HIGH (risk_score 73)
// Twofold impact: loss of local filtering AND loss of block-log telemetry.
// Status: PROPOSAL - not validated against production telemetry.
process where event.type == "start"
  and process.name : ("powershell.exe", "pwsh.exe", "netsh.exe")
  and process.args : ("Set-NetFirewallProfile", "advfirewall")
  and process.args : ("False", "off", "disable")
